    "text": "<p>The number of elements in the set</p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>S</mi><mo>=</mo><mfenced open=\"{\" close=\"}\"><mrow><mi>x</mi><mo>&#8712;</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">&#8477;</mi><mo>:</mo><mn>2</mn><mi>cos</mi><mfenced><mfrac><mrow><msup><mi>x</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>+</mo><mi>x</mi></mrow><mn>6</mn></mfrac></mfenced><mo>=</mo><msup><mn>4</mn><mi>x</mi></msup><mo>+</mo><msup><mn>4</mn><mrow><mo>-</mo><mi>x</mi></mrow></msup></mrow></mfenced></math>&nbsp;is</p>",
